This project was developed by 23DIT066 Vinit Saspara, 23DIT020 Divy Kalathiya, and 23DIT008 Harsh Dhameliya
as part of the **Summer Internship 2026**. We are students of **Charotar University of Science and Technology (CHARUSAT)**, 
and this project was successfully completed during our internship at **Appifly Infotech** under the valuable guidance 
and mentorship of **Mr. Veenet Devani**.

The project was a collaborative effort in which each team member contributed significantly. Vinit Saspara was primarily responsible 
for developing the backend architecture and implementing the server-side logic. Divy Kalathiya developed the backend APIs and 
played a key role in integrating them with the frontend. Harsh Dhameliya designed and developed the frontend, 
created the database schema, and contributed to the overall system design.

From the initial planning phase to the final implementation, all team members worked together to analyze requirements, 
design the system, solve technical challenges, and successfully deliver the project. This experience strengthened our 
technical knowledge, teamwork, problem-solving abilities, and software development skills.
